<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-08T19:49:46.929Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:49:46 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits in Zamfara continue to attack villages, locking families inside homes and setting them on fire, killing multiple members and abducting residents, while similar arson attacks have burned families alive in the state. In Ogun, police rescued ten abducted passengers and killed a suspected kidnapper, and separate road crashes killed three people and injured seven. A rally in Delta saw one person killed and five injured, and cattle rustlers were repelled in Kaduna with the recovery of stolen cows. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNOXh0ajdPNjJrQmJESDBtUV9HNExKYWdOVVd4ZDcwWHVMWF9fYjBVNjE4RWhIUXlkZ3d6ZWw5Rk5ZQklTT1h2emN2UGZrc3VVemwxS016OURJSlk5LXh2SEZ4bE9UYzJ2VWRKajNhdWh1U09UNmlpWmI0aHBXM2lHb0htdFhOM2JxY3FvOUQwQThjRWZ4LXJtNDQ5UjhmZVBfNzZOWmFGOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxPWDN0YUxKSEpaWlM0amtsQUdVZVktZXFpRFdUS2dqZ1JzT0h3NWtHTkkzRHdTOURvVi15aDFVaXNnS0lHQTZWSUxkLXc0YnlRX1kwZE5CTXlvb0pTZ3dMZ1owalcyY1BqdlZXZW5ObFBBbXdydUlBTnIxRmtLOVRfTDBKU3gwbFU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Independent Newspaper Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE5qemtrbENjR0draWUzZ0hxek53eWRseW1mbWVvTXhDQk44ZFNXUWRVSndhbDByUGczUHlWTXdXTDZ0SkltaFVBUjd0WmtLamZhS1pwVWZXc2l2aTIxdmNKNkl3cmtUUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;PRNigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQeVBnR1RFeGd2NU5OeW5TbFNSRW5EbEUwYzZqdDNna3NmNm9YZWRRekFUenQ4Ykpxa0lOTGQ1dDBYVjA3amRDY2puRkVscWRzakNXNTV2RmR3bjNVaGVfN3Z4dTZHbWM0QUZlNjAzWG9DdUR1TGQ5V0hhYVdhMkdINW1GSDFEU29XbHpubnVuSm5vYUpzTWZla0JiRU5rMGFu?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV9